# Copy this to .claude-relay-credentials.env (same folder, no .example)
# and fill in real values. That file is git-ignored on purpose -- it
# never gets committed, never gets fetched by the skill's bootstrap from
# GitHub, and is read only by Claude sessions that are linked to THIS
# device, straight off local disk, at the point log-find actually needs
# it. See SKILL.md's "Auto-loading relay credentials" section for exactly
# how and when it's read, and relay/README.md for what these values are
# and how to generate them.
#
# A session that isn't linked to this device never sees this file at
# all -- it just falls back to local-only find logging, same as if the
# relay didn't exist.

MUSHROOM_LOG_RELAY_URL=https://mushroom-relay.yeylandwutani.com
MUSHROOM_LOG_RELAY_TOKEN=
